{"id": "EUVD-2026-75327", "enisaUuid": "b5898772-67b4-3381-9cb9-8d3441d80f2c", "description": "A flaw was found in crun. When the container configuration does not give /dev a dedicated mount, terminal setup can redirect /dev/console onto an attacker-controlled path, including via the read-only-rootfs bind-mount fallback. Affected versions are crun 1.29.1 and earlier. Default configurations that mount a fresh /dev are not exposed. No fixed release is available yet.", "datePublished": "2026-09-10T08:40:36", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-25T22:28:39", "baseScore": 5.6, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:H/PR:L/UI:N/S:C/C:N/I:H/A:N", "references": ["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:71668", "https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-88264", "https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2531223", "https://github.com/containers/crun/"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-88264", "GHSA-ppgw-cqj8-9qrg"], "assigner": "redhat", "epss": 0.12, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0a5bbb41-f517-3f01-a3d6-6d1476441b05", "product": {"name": "crun", "vendor": {"name": "containers"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.29.1"}, {"id": "4c353f41-234e-37bd-97fa-584336d9ce90", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Hardened Images", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 1.30-1.hum1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "1001629b-a121-3b7b-9104-b85a2d2599cb", "vendor": {"name": "containers"}}, {"id": "5c5a9a6c-3b0f-31f6-bcd0-5e862ef21b31", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}], "isExploited": false}